imx477-rpi-dkms (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release as a DKMS source package.
  * Drop-in replacement for in-kernel imx477 driver, adding 4-lane MIPI
    CSI-2, refined PLL settings across 150 to 1050 MHz link frequency
    and refined line length limits.
  * Separate kurokesu-imx477 overlay with 4lane and link-frequency
    options.

 -- Danius Kalvaitis <danius@kurokesu.com>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:38:02 +0200
